{"title":"Impedimenta Developerum!","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/967670072/0/marginalrevolution~Impedimenta-Developerum.html","date":1786447205000,"content":"<blockquote><p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nme.com/news/film/harry-potter-fans-succeed-moving-construction-project-avoid-dobby-grave-3961714\">NME</a>: Harry Potter fans have succeeded in moving a construction project that would have originally gone through the “grave” of the character Dobby.</p>\r\n<p>The 125-mile Greenlink power connector, which costs £430million, is intended to link power between the UK’s National Grid and Ireland, running between County Wexford and Freshwater West in Pembrokeshire.</p>\r\n<p>However, the latter site is known to <i>Potter</i> fans as the site of house elf Dobby’s grave in the film <i>Harry Potter And The Deathly Hallows</i>, and contains a pile of stones with the words “here lies Dobby” that many flock to…</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>All I can say is that Voldemort would never have put up with this shit.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/08/impedimenta-developerum.html\">Impedimenta Developerum!</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/967670072/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/967670072/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/967670072/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/967670072/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://